>>SOURCE FORMAT FREE
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PAYHIST.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-LINE                     PIC X(512).
01 OUTCOME-CODE                   PIC X(32).
01 CURRENT-HISTORY                PIC X(16).
01 OUTPUT-CODE                    PIC X(16).

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN.
    ACCEPT INPUT-LINE
    UNSTRING INPUT-LINE DELIMITED BY "|"
        INTO OUTCOME-CODE CURRENT-HISTORY
    END-UNSTRING
    EVALUATE OUTCOME-CODE
        WHEN "SUCCESS_INTERNAL"
            MOVE "ACCEPTED" TO OUTPUT-CODE
        WHEN "SUCCESS_EXTERNAL"
            MOVE "ACCEPTED" TO OUTPUT-CODE
        WHEN "REJECTED"
            MOVE "REJECTED" TO OUTPUT-CODE
        WHEN "DUPLICATE"
            MOVE CURRENT-HISTORY TO OUTPUT-CODE
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE "UNKNOWN" TO OUTPUT-CODE
    END-EVALUATE
    DISPLAY FUNCTION TRIM(OUTPUT-CODE)
    STOP RUN.
